{:paths ["src" "test"]
 ;; The kernel requires no sibling module and no third-party library: it may
 ;; require rank-0 code (kmet.libs.*, kmet.loader.*), so those edges are added
 ;; here when a namespace first needs one.
 ;;
 ;; :deps is the SRC edge list. The self-containment guard (test_guards.clj)
 ;; walks these sources with babashka/fs, but a test-only library belongs to
 ;; the test project, not here: this file is a :local/root dependency, and
 ;; tools.deps never applies a dependency's aliases, so a test alias in it
 ;; could not reach a test classpath. The root deps.edn's :dev alias declares
 ;; it (babashka bundles it and Jolt vendors it, so only the JVM resolves it).
 :deps {}}
